{"status":"ready","content":"I need to compute 987654321².\n\nLet me break this down using the identity (a)² = a²:\n\n987654321² = 987654321 × 987654321\n\nI'll compute this by breaking it into parts. Let me use:\n987654321 = 987654321\n\nActually, let me compute this directly by careful multiplication:\n\n987654321\n×987654321\n___________\n\nLet me use the formula (10⁹ - 12345679)² since 987654321 = 1000000000 - 12345679:\n\n(10⁹ - 12345679)²\n= 10¹⁸ - 2(10⁹)(12345679) + 12345679²\n\nFirst: 12345679² = 152415567654321\n\nSecond: 2(10⁹)(12345679) = 24691358000000000\n\nTherefore:\n= 1000000000000000000\n-  24691358000000000\n+    152415567654321\n___________________________\n= 975461057789971041\n\nThe answer is **975461057789971041**.\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"Claude Sonnet 4.5","modelId":"anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5","promptId":"31-own-Large-Square","content":"I need to compute 987654321².\n\nLet me break this down using the identity (a)² = a²:\n\n987654321² = 987654321 × 987654321\n\nI'll compute this by breaking it into parts. Let me use:\n987654321 = 987654321\n\nActually, let me compute this directly by careful multiplication:\n\n987654321\n×987654321\n___________\n\nLet me use the formula (10⁹ - 12345679)² since 987654321 = 1000000000 - 12345679:\n\n(10⁹ - 12345679)²\n= 10¹⁸ - 2(10⁹)(12345679) + 12345679²\n\nFirst: 12345679² = 152415567654321\n\nSecond: 2(10⁹)(12345679) = 24691358000000000\n\nTherefore:\n= 1000000000000000000\n-  24691358000000000\n+    152415567654321\n___________________________\n= 975461057789971041\n\nThe answer is **975461057789971041**.\n","inferredMetadata":{"inferred":true,"sourcePath":"scripts/responses/claude-sonnet-4-5/31-own-Large-Square.json","modelSlug":"claude-sonnet-4-5","modelFamily":"claude_mid_tier","modelReleaseDate":"Sep 2025","modelSource":"openrouter"},"prompt":{"id":"31-own-Large-Square","text":"Compute 987654321 squared exactly.","tags":["reasoning","math"]}},"path":"responses/claude-sonnet-4-5/31-own-Large-Square